sequenceDiagram
  participant B as Browser
  participant A as API
  participant D as PostgreSQL
  participant S as Private S3
  B->>A: POST /v1/transfers (descriptors + idempotency key)
  Note over A: Slice 06 routes are test-only until Slice 07 security activation
  A->>D: Validate admission + atomic idempotency claim and transfer/files
  D-->>A: Committed
  A-->>B: One-time management secret + inactive share URL + signed PUTs
  par Max 3 concurrent uploads
    B->>S: Signed PUT object 1
    B->>S: Signed PUT object N
  end
  B->>A: POST /v1/transfers/id/complete
  A->>D: Claim VERIFYING (version CAS + 60-second lease)
  loop Expected files (bounded fanout)
    A->>S: HEAD object / verify size
  end
  A->>D: Atomically record VERIFIED and READY if lease/version/expiry valid
  A-->>B: READY status (existing share URL becomes usable)
